  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EAV is a pioneer in the off grid / access to energy sector and has to date built up an initial portfolio of six companies, including: three Solar Home Systems companies, a &#x2018;gas for-cooking&#x2019; start-up and two &#x2018;energy for agriculture&#x2019; businesses (solar irrigation and solar-based cold storage). EAV targets somewhere between 15-20 investees in order to secure sufficient diversification. FMO&#x2019;s commitment will be deployed both in new investments as well as in (follow-on) investments in existing portfolio companies.</narrative>
  </description>
